{"id":"4592616060bd3fd7","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Node55a3.md","title":"Node55a3","display":"Node55a3","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"Node55a3","parameters":["x0","x1","x2","z"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"Node55a3"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>x0</span><span>x1</span><span>x2</span><span>z</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：二阶语法与语义。有序参数：<code>x0</code>、<code>x1</code>、<code>x2</code>、<code>z</code>。</p>\n<p>带自然数标签的集合构造子；不同标签分离。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ Node55a3 x0 x1 x2 z)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z1419\n  (exists z1420\n    (and\n      (@ Num55 z1419)\n      (and (exists z1421 (and (@ Pair x1 x2 z1421) (@ Pair x0 z1421 z1420))) (@ Pair z1419 z1420 z)))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7e5eb3e7374c637b\" href=\"?note=7e5eb3e7374c637b\" title=\"ZFC_Num55\">Num55</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ Node55a3 x0 x1 x2 z)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Num55","status":"resolved","id":"7e5eb3e7374c637b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Num55|Num55]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Pair","status":"resolved","id":"0a7fe33bb2e95221","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Num55|Num55]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":917,"backlinks":[{"id":"b10bd78951872ea5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Node55a3|Node55a3]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-419","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_Node55a3|Node55a3]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","7e5eb3e7374c637b","0a7fe33bb2e95221","593f9bdab4d60707"]}